73
00:02:47,043 --> 00:02:48,443
Right. Hello.

74
00:02:48,443 --> 00:02:49,643
- Hello.
- Hello.

75
00:02:49,643 --> 00:02:52,113
Gujwa is famous for its carrots. Carrot juice or carrot shake.

76
00:02:52,113 --> 00:02:54,613
