81
00:03:02,353 --> 00:03:03,593
When I was six years old.

82
00:03:03,593 --> 00:03:05,663
- I see.
- My family moved here...

83
00:03:05,663 --> 00:03:07,133
- because of my dad's work.
- You lived here for a short time.

84
00:03:07,193 --> 00:03:09,863
I lived here for about a year and went to kindergarten.

85
00:03:10,603 --> 00:03:12,463
I remember living near the beach.

86
00:03:12,463 --> 00:03:13,533
I see.

87
00:03:13,533 --> 00:03:14,933
The tangerine orchards surrounded my house.

88
00:03:14,933 --> 00:03:16,443
(The tangerine orchards surrounded my house.)

89
00:03:16,443 --> 00:03:17,643
I thought it was something recent,

90
00:03:17,643 --> 00:03:19,203
