108
00:03:55,073 --> 00:03:57,613
- Pill bugs are common in Seoul too.
- They aren't in Seoul.

109
00:03:57,613 --> 00:03:58,643
- Yes, they are.
- They aren't in Seoul.

110
00:03:58,643 --> 00:03:59,683
- Yes, they are.
- They are.

111
00:03:59,683 --> 00:04:01,453
Your question sounded like...

112
00:04:01,453 --> 00:04:03,623
