116
00:04:08,793 --> 00:04:09,993
- Ants?
- You tasted it?

117
00:04:09,993 --> 00:04:12,163
I remember grabbing one and eating it.

118
00:04:12,163 --> 00:04:13,193
It was very sour.

119
00:04:13,193 --> 00:04:14,963
There were kids who ate ants back then.

120
00:04:15,063 --> 00:04:17,303
You were something else even as a kid.

121
00:04:17,303 --> 00:04:18,463
(You were something else even as a kid.)

122
00:04:18,703 --> 00:04:20,033
I'll leave it at that.

123
00:04:20,033 --> 00:04:21,073
Okay.

124
00:04:21,803 --> 00:04:23,603
I won't call you crazy or anything.

125
00:04:23,673 --> 00:04:25,803
- I'm just full of surprises.
- But you already did.

126
00:04:25,803 --> 00:04:26,943
She ate it once in a while as a kid.

127
00:04:26,943 --> 00:04:28,543
