- Longitude.

149
00:05:09,653 --> 00:05:11,423
- You were the Earth Defense Force.
- Longitude 43.

150
00:05:11,423 --> 00:05:12,723
- I had the coordinates.
- You were the Earth Defense Force.

151
00:05:12,983 --> 00:05:14,953
- The real Earth Defense Force.
- I got in so much trouble.

152
00:05:15,753 --> 00:05:18,563
- Thank you. The shake looks tasty.
- Thank you.

153
00:05:19,393 --> 00:05:21,063
