1023
00:35:52,040 --> 00:35:54,570
I use buckwheat in every dish.

1024
00:35:54,570 --> 00:35:58,710
I farm a 8264m²-big buckwheat farm with my son.

1025
00:35:58,710 --> 00:36:02,080
(Farming a 8264m²-big buckwheat farm)

1026
00:36:02,080 --> 00:36:05,080
I want to serve good food to those who come.

1027
00:36:05,580 --> 00:36:07,450
So I continue to farm.

1028
00:36:08,020 --> 00:36:10,150
Jeju Island is well-known for its black pork.

1029
00:36:10,420 --> 00:36:12,460
So I mixed Jeju Island's black pork...

1030
00:36:12,460 --> 00:36:14,760
