1031
00:36:14,960 --> 00:36:18,930
to make my restaurant's unique buckwheat black pork cutlet.

1032
00:36:20,130 --> 00:36:23,200
Guys, have you ever tried black pork cutlet...

1033
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:25,040
