1034
00:36:25,040 --> 00:36:26,700
(It became widely popular for its savory taste!)

1035
00:36:26,970 --> 00:36:30,440
Sixth Sense crew, is this place real?

1036
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:32,910
(Sixth Sense crew, is this place real?)

1037
00:36:33,210 --> 00:36:36,610
