1038
00:36:36,610 --> 00:36:37,780
Yes, I'll prepare it.

1039
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:39,450
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1040
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,890
I'll have to try it first to decide.

1041
00:36:42,050 --> 00:36:44,650
But the place itself is somewhat unbalanced.

1042
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:49,060
The welfare center should become a resting area...

1043
