1097
00:39:09,870 --> 00:39:12,500
(It's pretty thick for Korean-style Western pork cutlet.)

1098
00:39:12,870 --> 00:39:14,870
This pork must've been really big.

1099
00:39:14,870 --> 00:39:16,170
