1112
00:39:47,200 --> 00:39:49,240
It's delicious.

1113
00:39:49,240 --> 00:39:50,270
- But...
- Right.

1114
00:39:51,910 --> 00:39:53,210
It's so good.

1115
00:39:53,210 --> 00:39:54,240
(Nodding)

1116
00:39:54,240 --> 00:39:55,650
- It's good.
- It is.

1117
00:39:55,650 --> 00:39:57,410
Black pork can't taste bad.

1118
00:39:58,250 --> 00:39:59,320
It's good.

1119
