1159
00:41:36,010 --> 00:41:38,050
The noodles taste amazing.

1160
00:41:38,050 --> 00:41:39,180
(The pleasant savory taste spreads in their mouths.)

1161
00:41:39,680 --> 00:41:41,080
It's so savory.

1162
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:42,850
