1178
00:42:14,980 --> 00:42:17,220
- The "in Jeju" is way too blatant.
- It's way too blatant.

1179
00:42:18,020 --> 00:42:19,520
- "In Jeju."
- "In Jeju?"

1180
00:42:19,520 --> 00:42:21,090
The production crew must've...

1181
00:42:21,320 --> 00:42:24,690
This place feels a bit off.

1182
00:42:24,690 --> 00:42:25,700
Yes.

1183
00:42:25,700 --> 00:42:28,260
It does feel quite suspicious.

1184
00:42:28,260 --> 00:42:29,270
It does.

1185
00:42:29,270 --> 00:42:30,530
