1193
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:54,990
He read "When Buckwheat Flowers Bloom" in 120 seconds?

1194
00:42:54,990 --> 00:42:56,060
("When Buckwheat Flowers Bloom," Record: 120 seconds)

1195
00:42:56,230 --> 00:42:58,030
Is there such an award?

1196
00:42:58,030 --> 00:42:59,500
- Such an award...
- Exactly.

1197
00:42:59,500 --> 00:43:00,530
This...

1198
00:43:01,530 --> 00:43:04,600
A 15m bungee jump? Why did he put this here?

1199
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:08,500
Can you climb Mount Halla in 255 minutes?

1200
00:43:10,170 --> 00:43:14,440
