1208
00:43:29,630 --> 00:43:31,660
- It doesn't show the time.
- You're right.

1209
00:43:31,660 --> 00:43:33,530
- It doesn't show the time.
- Look at this. Eun I...

1210
00:43:33,530 --> 00:43:36,430
I got the certificate of climbing Mount Halla.

1211
00:43:36,430 --> 00:43:38,000
But it doesn't state the time.

1212
00:43:38,230 --> 00:43:39,770
- It only states the date.
- Exactly.

1213
00:43:39,770 --> 00:43:40,940
Your name and the date.

1214
00:43:40,940 --> 00:43:44,070
(The owner's certificate has the time record.)

1215
00:43:45,010 --> 00:43:46,340
(Date)

1216
00:43:46,340 --> 00:43:50,150
(Eun I's certificate doesn't have the record!)

1217
00:43:51,080 --> 00:43:54,520
Right? The numbers were...

1218
00:43:54,520 --> 00:43:55,920
A 15m bungee jump.

1219
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:57,720
