- And 120 seconds.

1220
00:43:57,720 --> 00:43:59,420
- And 120 seconds.
- And 255 minutes.

1221
00:43:59,420 --> 00:44:01,660
- And 255 minutes.
- Right.

1222
00:44:01,760 --> 00:44:03,960
What do you get when you add all the numbers?

1223
00:44:03,960 --> 00:44:05,630
Are the numbers the hints?

1224
00:44:05,630 --> 00:44:08,500
- Yes, the numbers seem suspicious.
- Fifteen...

1225
00:44:08,500 --> 00:44:12,670
If you add 120, 255, and 15,

1226
00:44:12,670 --> 00:44:14,670
