1230
00:44:19,210 --> 00:44:22,110
What does 400 mean?

1231
00:44:22,110 --> 00:44:23,110
(The answer is actually 390.)

1232
00:44:23,110 --> 00:44:24,250
Four hundred?

1233
00:44:24,250 --> 00:44:25,820
(None of them realize because they're all bad at math.)

1234
00:44:25,820 --> 00:44:27,780
I think it is a B-Side.

1235
00:44:27,920 --> 00:44:29,520
It's just that we can't figure it out.

1236
00:44:29,520 --> 00:44:30,720
(What do the numbers mean?)

1237
00:44:30,720 --> 00:44:33,420
- This is Pyeongdae.
- Pyeongdae Beach.

1238
00:44:34,260 --> 00:44:36,130
I want to jump in.

1239
00:44:36,930 --> 00:44:39,630
(Refreshing blue sea)

1240
00:44:40,760 --> 00:44:43,330
It's so pretty here.

1241
00:44:43,330 --> 00:44:44,500
It's pretty.

1242
00:44:45,400 --> 00:44:46,640
It's really pretty.

1243
00:44:46,640 --> 00:44:47,800
(Come to Pyeongdae Beach!)

1244
00:44:47,800 --> 00:44:50,440
