1245
00:44:50,610 --> 00:44:52,610
- I feel happy.
- It feels good.

1246
00:44:53,180 --> 00:44:55,110
The sea is so pretty.

1247
00:44:55,110 --> 00:44:57,110
(It's so pretty!)

1248
00:44:57,110 --> 00:44:58,880
- The birds are sitting there.
- This is...

1249
00:44:59,650 --> 00:45:01,120
- Look at the birds.
- The birds.

1250
00:45:01,280 --> 00:45:02,320
How cute.

1251
00:45:02,850 --> 00:45:04,520
Are they the B-Sides?

1252
00:45:04,520 --> 00:45:06,190
- Are they the B-Sides?
- B-Sides?

1253
00:45:06,190 --> 00:45:08,190
If they go that far, I have to give it to them.

1254
00:45:08,690 --> 00:45:09,690
Getting the birds to sit there.

1255
00:45:09,690 --> 00:45:11,890
"The serial numbers on the birds' legs!"

1256
00:45:11,890 --> 00:45:13,000
Something like this.

1257
00:45:13,330 --> 00:45:15,060
On their legs.

1258
00:45:15,060 --> 00:45:16,100
(A B-Side addict)

1259
00:45:16,100 --> 00:45:18,230
"Didn't you check their feet? It was all there."

1260
00:45:18,230 --> 00:45:19,670
If they do that, I'll make them pay.

1261
00:45:20,170 --> 00:45:21,270
"I'll make them pay."

1262
00:45:23,070 --> 00:45:26,780
(The B-Side addicts have arrived at the third place!)

1263
00:45:26,780 --> 00:45:28,010
It's so pretty.

1264
00:45:29,280 --> 00:45:30,610
Forget filming whatnot.

1265
00:45:31,710 --> 00:45:33,020
(Laughing)

1266
00:45:34,480 --> 00:45:36,990
Isn't the path so pretty? A path between stone walls.

1267
00:45:37,120 --> 00:45:38,550
It's so pretty.

1268
00:45:38,550 --> 00:45:40,120
(The basalt walls make you want to stop working.)

1269
00:45:40,890 --> 00:45:42,430
